        "original_id": "8aea88a8-829d-599d-836a-bfb442e43d2c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Tashlin, Craig Serling\n- Roles: animator, screenwriter, film director, film producer, television editor\n- Awards: Primetime Emmy Awards\n- Works: Jam\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Tashlin was born as Francis Fredrick von Taschlein on February 19, 1913.\n- Frank Tashlin was an American animator, screenwriter, and film director.\n- Craig Serling is an American film director, film producer, screenwriter, and television editor.\n- Craig Serling received multiple Primetime Emmy nominations for Outstanding Picture Editing for Non-Fiction Programming.\n- Craig Serling made his feature film directorial debut with Jam in 2006.\n- Frank Tashlin died on May 5, 1972.",
